[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グウゥ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grrrr..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "人造頂獣",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man-made Apexi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "動きが止まった……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It stopped moving...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、今のうちに捕縛――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good, now we can capture—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこまで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's enough!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！\u3000その声は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh! That voice..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやあ、皆見事な戦いぶりだったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, everyone! That was quite the impressive battle!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロマン君！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく、肝が冷える計画だった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly, that plan was impressive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ブラッド",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おや？\u3000まだ私の人造頂獣を信用していないのですか？\nお望み通りの動きをしたと思いますが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? You don't believe I can keep my man-made Apexi under control? You've personally witnessed how it performed - exactly as I had commanded."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ブラッドにワルターも！？\nどういうことよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad and Walther too?! What's going on here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……すべて、騎士試験の一環だったということだ。\n落石も、人造頂獣の暴走もでっち上げだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This was all part of the knight examination. The rockfall, the rampaging Apexi—it was all staged."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はああ！？\u3000あんたやりすぎじゃない！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WHAT?! Don't you think that was taking it a too far?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も先ほど知ったんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is news to me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナにも内緒でやらせてもらったよ。\n志願者たちの本当の力を見たかったからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I kept Juna in the dark as I wanted to see the candidates' true capabilities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我が国はこの短期間で二度も大きな危機に直面した。\n今後もこれを上回る危機が訪れるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our nation has faced two major crises in a short period. We'll likely face even greater dangers in the future."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それを乗り越えるには、今まで以上の働きが\n騎士には求められる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To overcome them, our knights will need to perform beyond what's been expected of them before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして君たちに必要だったのは、団結力。\n最初の試験を見ていて、私はそう判断した",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And the key ingredient was teamwork. That's what I concluded after watching your first exam."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たくさん視線を感じたとは思ってたけど、\nあんたたちも見てたのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought I felt eyes on us the whole time. So you were watching us too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この短期間で成長し、秘密の試験を\n見事な連携で乗り越えて見せた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've grown in such a short time and overcome this secret test with remarkable coordination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今なら分かるだろう？\n騎士たちに求められている強さが、なんなのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now you understand, don't you? The kind of strength that is expected of knights?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ということで、ここにいる全員、実技試験は合格だ。\n筆記試験も頑張ってくれたまえ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With that, everyone here passes the practical exam. I bid you good luck on the written portion!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだったー！\u3000すっかり全部終わった気になってた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh right! I completely forgot we still had the written test!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "というか、この試験を計画したのは\nロマンあんたなの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, so it was YOU who planned this test, Roman?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいや？\u3000善意の協力者さ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all. I've just been a benevolent collaborator."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "教えなさいよ！\u3000そいつぶっ飛ばしてやるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell me who it was! I'm going to punch them into next week!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは。それは、難しいかもしれないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha. That might be difficult."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……くしゅん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Achoo!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう、暇ね。早く結果を知らせに来ないかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sigh, how boring. I wish someone would come tell me the results already."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、それならあの人造頂獣に可哀そうな\nことしちゃったなあ……痛かったよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if it was all staged, then we were pretty mean to that man-made Apexi... We went all out..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気にする必要はありません。\n彼にとってあれくらいじゃれ合いにすぎませんので",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no cause for concern. That was merely roughhousing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、起きてください。\nもう大丈夫ですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, get up. I know you're alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ガルル！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grrrr!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "人造頂獣",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man-made Apexi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よしよし、いい子ですね。\nやられた演技も申し分ありませんでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There, there, good boy. You performed splendidly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ワルター",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に言う事を聞いているのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really does obey you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、なんのためにこんなことを？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But why go through all this trouble?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]